          <img src="https://static.tildacdn.com/tild6266-3734-4261-a562-653736653436/photo-1762117360986-.jpg" alt="Готовый дом ВБЕТОН" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          <div class="vx-cta__img-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
